<title>FRANCE: MONEP had tech. problem, Suez options suspended.</title>
<headline>MONEP had tech. problem, Suez options suspended.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French MONEP options exchange said it had a brief technical problem during which all options on shares were suspended.</p>
<p>Trading has since resumed for all options on shares with the exception of options on shares in Suez.</p>
</text>
